  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "鳥仔來挵門"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">作者：</span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>Tân Ūn-jû（陳韻如）</b></span></p><p><br /></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">你透早來挵門</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Suah去tn̄g著蜘蛛leh kenn絲</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">看你bē-tín-bē動</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Hōo人看著tsiânn m̄甘</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">我拍開窗仔門</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">想beh緊kā你身軀頂ê束縛tháu--開</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">你tio̍h生驚</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">M̄知影目睭前tsit个人leh pìnn啥báng</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">舞規晡</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">總算無koh纏跤絆手</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">驚你走bē離</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Liam-mi koh tńg去看hōo真</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">啥mi̍h to無</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">不而過　你揣著tńg--去ê路--ah</span></p><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEj8iRY3hPJtcuouq_C4b7Cu5PSWZPyJfUFO9v0loAuqyMX5maSD5uOMuEs_x96Ut5O3cAot6Xesf7ynL1ygMOaqmZmO2wOTi_t89cFxNhtrZ7RwzYWPdLrHvw69UQC-UYWyGmSasjAWJbGhwlTv3bEPehZk0fb6KgJDsqDmnGIyKBqRgwhiJrMifxtsv73Z/s3107/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1373%E6%9C%9F_4.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3107\" data-original-width=\"2221\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEj8iRY3hPJtcuouq_C4b7Cu5PSWZPyJfUFO9v0loAuqyMX5maSD5uOMuEs_x96Ut5O3cAot6Xesf7ynL1ygMOaqmZmO2wOTi_t89cFxNhtrZ7RwzYWPdLrHvw69UQC-UYWyGmSasjAWJbGhwlTv3bEPehZk0fb6KgJDsqDmnGIyKBqRgwhiJrMifxtsv73Z/w458-h640/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1373%E6%9C%9F_4.jpg\" width=\"458\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgbwDpJV9uHmo1ZJYGYOE2uFvJ9R15g2oVD2_CnZt3z9QjSn8cVbKjBFSXTp0_yM08uf0Dms2z4ohjyYk3rS2wfZ4RX5hfPor-7LXBmdb-TyPY7rLgkqsGyFvphO6Gv3hOr65lmpF95YDKQSSxz6jD0y-AickYB29BrtKtBdGSn_W63EHXMvMLeOesKuKGP/s4000/%E5%9C%96%20%E9%99%B3%E9%9F%BB%E5%A6%82%20%E9%B3%A5%E4%BB%94%E4%BE%86%E6%8C%B5%E9%96%80.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3000\" data-original-width=\"4000\" height=\"480\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgbwDpJV9uHmo1ZJYGYOE2uFvJ9R15g2oVD2_CnZt3z9QjSn8cVbKjBFSXTp0_yM08uf0Dms2z4ohjyYk3rS2wfZ4RX5hfPor-7LXBmdb-TyPY7rLgkqsGyFvphO6Gv3hOr65lmpF95YDKQSSxz6jD0y-AickYB29BrtKtBdGSn_W63EHXMvMLeOesKuKGP/w640-h480/%E5%9C%96%20%E9%99%B3%E9%9F%BB%E5%A6%82%20%E9%B3%A5%E4%BB%94%E4%BE%86%E6%8C%B5%E9%96%80.jpg\" width=\"640\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a name='more'></a><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEi7xVhaQSIa_stRzh93h1aep0ztMI7X613UW0orSmXEhmMRtF9JdrI4rext4N5U_ehpwMhEj1Ysac2TdRD20ZFvOBNPM8xvuFPNPUygLwYOkHCqw2VvPfKD2tJPx_-o6X2W